.TH DCOMP-HEALTHCHECK 1 "August 2026" "DComp 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dcomp-healthcheck \- probe a DComp Component health endpoint
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dcomp-healthcheck
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B dcomp-healthcheck
is the health probe companion to DComp. It is intended for use by component
container health checks and speaks the DComp Component health protocol.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dcomp (1)
